// note: the dashboard's demand query, the demand line over the generation chart, rooftop solar included (page state: 1 year to 2026-08-11, all)
EVALUATE CALCULATETABLE(SUMMARIZECOLUMNS(dim_calendar[date], "demand", [Demand with rooftop MWh]), dim_calendar[date] >= dt"2026-07-28", dim_calendar[date] <= dt"2026-08-11") ORDER BY [date]
